OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FTuesday will get off to a
OL,6,Frather grey and breezy start with some
OL,7,Ffog patches over the hills and a
OL,8,Flittle drizzle in places. It will
OL,9,Fgradually brighten up though, with
OL,10,Fsome warm spells of sunshine
OL,11,Fdeveloping for the afternoon.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FA fine end to the day with
OL,14,Fsome evening sunshine. Overnight,
OL,15,Fareas of low cloud will reform, giving
OL,16,Fsome hill fog. The odd spot of drizzle
OL,17,Flater. Another warm night.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
