OL,3,GWales
OL,4,
OL,5,CWednesday:FA grey morning in the north
OL,6,Fand west with patchy drizzle. Warm
OL,7,Fsunshine developing for the afternoon,
OL,8,Fespecially in the south and east,
OL,9,Fthough showers possible in the
OL,10,Fnorthwest later.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,13,FThursday will be fresher with sunshine
OL,14,Fand perhaps the odd shower. Mostly dry
OL,15,Fon Friday and Saturday with further
OL,16,Fsunshine developing at times. Still
OL,17,Fwarm in the sunshine.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
